     * @tc.desc      LIGHT 模式下 pt_Latn_BR 字符串 Manual_mode 与期望值一致
     * @tc.type      FUNCTION
     * @tc.size      SMALLTEST
     * @tc.level     LEVEL2
     */
    it('testResourceLocaleHugeMatrix0074', TestType.FUNCTION | Size.SMALLTEST | Level.LEVEL2, async () => {
